message: >-
  If you use this software in teaching material, a publication or a
  product, please cite it as below.
title: "anywidget-instruments: instrumentation widgets for computational notebooks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Celles
    given-names: Sébastien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9987-4338"
    affiliation: "Université de Poitiers"
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-celles/anywidget-instruments"
url: "https://s-celles.github.io/anywidget-instruments/"
abstract: >-
  Knobs, gauges, LEDs, charts, alarms and supervisory objects (PID
  faceplate, state machine, alarm list, SVG faceplates) for Jupyter,
  marimo and other anywidget hosts, with a trait contract in JSON Schema
  shared by Python, TypeScript and other host languages.
keywords:
  - instrumentation
  - human-machine interface
  - widgets
  - notebooks
  - anywidget
  - industrial automation
  - education
